OL,3,GNEWSATories did not cut police for fun,
OL,4,Asays leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,7,Fsaid she did not accept police cuts by
OL,8,Fthe Conservative-led coalition
OL,9,Fgovernment in 2010 were a mistake.
OL,11,FLabour MPs in the Cleveland Police area
OL,12,Fsaid the force was struggling to tackle
OL,13,Fthe highest crime levels in England,
OL,14,Fpartly because it lost 400 officers
OL,15,Fwhen David Cameron was prime minister.
OL,17,FExtra police officers were brought into
OL,18,Fthe force to support the investigation
OL,19,Fwhich followed the death of two police
OL,20,Fofficers and five young men in a crash
OL,21,Fon the A66 near Middlesbrough in
OL,22,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
