OL,3,GNEWSATories did not cut police for fun,
OL,4,Asays leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a BBC interview ahead of her party's
OL,7,Fannual conference, Badenoch said tough
OL,8,Fchoices had to be made because "there
OL,9,Fwas no money" left by the previous
OL,10,FLabour government.
